Bootstrap Scrollspy
Scrollspy — sahifani pastga/yuqoriga scroll qilganingda, navbar ichidagi qaysi section hozir ko‘rinayotgan bo‘lsa, o‘sha linkni avtomatik active qiladi.
Navbar:
[Section 1] [Section 2] [Section 3]

↓ scroll

Section 1 ko‘rinmoqda
→ Section 1 active

↓ scroll

Section 2 ko‘rinmoqda
→ Section 2 activ
1. Basic Scrollspy
<body data-spy="scroll"
      data-target=".navbar"
      data-offset="50"
      style="position: relative;">

    <nav class="navbar navbar-inverse navbar-fixed-top">

        <div class="container-fluid">

            <ul class="nav navbar-nav">
                <li>
                    <a href="#section1">Section 1</a>
                </li>

                <li>
                    <a href="#section2">Section 2</a>
                </li>

                <li>
                    <a href="#section3">Section 3</a>
                </li>
            </ul>

        </div>
    </nav>


    <div id="section1" style="padding:100px 20px;">
        <h1>Section 1</h1>
        <p>Bu Section 1.</p>
    </div>

    <div id="section2" style="padding:100px 20px;">
        <h1>Section 2</h1>
        <p>Bu Section 2.</p>
    </div>

    <div id="section3" style="padding:100px 20px;">
        <h1>Section 3</h1>
        <p>Bu Section 3.</p>
    </div>

</body>
