34. Bootstrap Scrollspy

→ Scroll qilganda navigation linkni
  avtomatik active qiladi.

data-spy="scroll"
→ Scrollspy'ni yoqadi

data-target=".navbar"
→ Navbar bilan bog‘laydi

data-target="#myScrollspy"
→ Berilgan menu bilan bog‘laydi

data-offset="50"
→ Tepadan 50px offset

href="#section1"
→ section1 ga bog‘laydi

id="section1"
→ Sectionning ID'si

.nav-pills
→ Pills menu

.nav-stacked
→ Vertical menu

.active
→ Hozirgi sectionning active linki
